      "text": "The third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\) is \\( 1 + x + x^{2} + x^{3} \\). Let \\( g(x) = \\cos(2x) f(x) \\). Find the third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = 0 \\)."
