         "step": 1,
         "text": "Start from \\( \\cos u = 1 - \\frac{u^{2}}{2!} + \\frac{u^{4}}{4!} - \\cdots \\). Replace \\( u \\) by \\( 2x \\), raising the whole of \\( 2x \\) to each power. Through degree 3, \\( \\cos(2x) \\approx 1 - 2x^{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
